      "title": "Third quarter dividend of ₹5.00 announced",
      "body": "Dividend of ₹5.00 is the same as last year. Ex-date: 30th January 2026 Payment date: 22nd February 2026 Dividend yield will be 1.6%, which is higher than the industry average of 1.4%. Sustainability & Growth Dividend is not covered by earnings (112% earnings payout ratio) nor is it covered by cash flows (119% cash payout ratio). The dividend has increased by an average of 27% per year over the past 10 years. However, payments have been volatile during that time. The company's earnings per share (EPS) would need to grow by 25% to bring the payout ratio under control. EPS is expected to grow by 46% over the next 2 years, which is sufficient to bring the dividend into a sustainable range.",
